Hi,

There is a problem in the hpt366.c driver where the function 
ide_config_drive_speed(drive, speed) is called without using the 
correct speed variable. The speed variable should use the value returned 
by hpt3xx_ratefilter which decides the speed after checking against the 
bad drives list.

I believe the following patch fixes the problem.

Best regards,

Jonas
